l)\">Tumble</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +17</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +17</a>:</b> Passive: +17 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{bac